        "People hire landscapers with their eyes. We build portfolio-first sites with your real project photos and an estimate form that collects photos and property details up front.",
        "Design-build, hardscape, maintenance, tree work and snow removal each get their own page, so a homeowner planning a patio and a property manager looking for weekly mowing both land somewhere that speaks to them."
