        "Google and Meta ads timed to the season: design and install in spring, maintenance contracts, fall cleanups and holiday lighting. Every lead feeds the same follow-up system.",
        "Meta works well for showing finished projects to homeowners in nicer neighborhoods. Google catches people already searching for a landscaper. We shift budget between them as the season changes, and pause ads when your schedule is full."
      ],
      "link": {
        "label": "Google & Meta Ads management",
        "href": "/services/ads/"
      }
    },
    {
      "eyebrow": "CRM & Automation",
      "heading": "A CRM for Estimates, Proposals and Renewals",
